{
    "_comment": "B5 fixture (config-contract Phase C, sprint S13). TEST-ONLY. Reference layer config — schema-valid, exercises every core-read leaf (data/styles/legends/tooltip/popup/sidepanel/search/table/clustering). Canonical geometry+tooltip.mode coexist with the geometryType+tooltipMode root aliases (ANO-007/008). Plugin-owned keys (edition.*, data.limit/realtime, mapping) are present for the B7/B9 renvoi reference. Per-value variations are produced by deepMerge override in s13-layer-*.",
    "id": "reference-points",
    "label": "Points de référence",
    "zIndex": 10,
    "geometry": "point",
    "geometryType": "point",
    "type": "poi",
    "plugin": "flatgeobuf",
    "interactiveShape": true,
    "showIconsOnMap": true,
    "edition": { "create": true, "update": true, "delete": false },
    "editableGeometryTypes": ["Point"],
    "_comment_write": "Posé à la tâche 7.2, et EXIGÉ par la règle A14 dès que `attributes.fields[].edit` apparaît ci-dessous — vu rougir dans cet ordre : `edit` seul rend `must have required property 'write'`. Cette fixture n'est jamais déployée et cet endpoint n'est jamais appelé ; son rôle est de porter toutes les formes légales, donc elle porte aussi celle-ci. `properties` liste le seul champ capturable, et reste la liste blanche d'expédition : ce qui n'y figure pas n'est jamais envoyé.",
    "write": {
        "enabled": true,
        "endpoint": "https://example.test/collections/reference-points",
        "dialect": "collection",
        "auth": "none",
        "properties": ["name"]
    },
    "data": {
        "directory": "layers/reference-points/data",
        "file": "reference-points.geojson",
        "format": "geojson",
        "licence": "ODbL",
        "limit": 5000,
        "autoRefresh": false,
        "headers": {
            "Accept": "application/geo+json"
        },
        "vectorTiles": {
            "enabled": false,
            "tilesDirectory": "layers/reference-points/tiles",
            "tilesUrl": "https://example.test/poi/{z}/{x}/{y}.pbf",
            "layerName": "poi",
            "minZoom": 0,
            "maxNativeZoom": 14,
            "maxZoom": 22,
            "interactive": true
        },
        "mapping": "reference-mapping"
    },
    "styles": {
        "directory": "styles",
        "default": "defaut.json",
        "available": [
            {
                "id": "defaut",
                "label": "Défaut",
                "file": "defaut.json"
            },
            {
                "id": "alt",
                "label": "Alternatif",
                "file": "alt.json"
            }
        ]
    },
    "legends": {
        "directory": "legends",
        "default": "defaut.legend.json"
    },
    "table": {
        "enabled": true,
        "columns": [
            {
                "field": "properties.name",
                "label": "Nom",
                "sortable": true,
                "width": "40%"
            },
            {
                "field": "properties.categoryId",
                "label": "Catégorie",
                "sortable": true
            }
        ],
        "searchFields": ["properties.name"],
        "defaultSort": {
            "field": "properties.name",
            "order": "asc"
        }
    },
    "clustering": {
        "enabled": true,
        "maxClusterRadius": 60,
        "disableClusteringAtZoom": 14
    },
    "attributes": {
        "titleField": "name",
        "fields": [
            {
                "field": "name",
                "label": "Nom",
                "primitive": "string",
                "widget": "text",
                "display": {
                    "surfaces": ["tooltip", "popup", "sidepanel"]
                },
                "edit": {
                    "required": true
                }
            },
            {
                "field": "categoryId",
                "label": "Catégorie",
                "primitive": "string",
                "widget": "text",
                "display": {
                    "surfaces": ["popup", "sidepanel"]
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}
